    "title": "Cops Nab San Rafael Man After Fires Spark Under 101 Overpass - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Eric Tanaka ,\n6 hours ago A 26-year-old San Rafael man was arrested yesterday after witnesses said he set several small fires beneath the Highway 101 overpass at North San Pedro Road. Neighbors and people driving by reported seeing someone burning trash, tree branches and shrubs, then trailed the suspect until officers caught up with him on Lincoln Avenue. Fire crews quickly put out the blazes, which caused only minor damage to roadway signs and nearby landscaping, according to authorities. Read full article",
